# Copy to `.env` (git-ignored) in this directory if you want to change anything. Nothing here is
# required for a local run.

# Secret used to sign access tokens (any random string of at least 32 characters).
# You do not need to set it locally: when it is unset and TASKAPP_ENVIRONMENT is `local` (the
# default), the API generates one the first time it needs it and keeps it in `.local-jwt-secret`
# (git-ignored, owner-only), so people stay signed in across restarts. Delete that file to sign
# everyone out. In any other environment the secret is required. To choose your own:
#   echo "TASKAPP_JWT_SECRET=$(python3 -c 'import secrets; print(secrets.token_urlsafe(48))')" >> .env
# TASKAPP_JWT_SECRET=<your secret>

# Defaults, matching docker-compose.yml. Uncomment to change them.
# TASKAPP_DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://taskflow:taskflow@localhost:5432/taskflow
# TASKAPP_REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0
